<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>aptistockx</id>
    <version>3.1.0</version>
    <title>AptiStockX</title>
    <authors>AptiStock LLC</authors>
    <owners>AptiStock LLC</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://aptistock.com/</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://aptistock.com/static/assets/aptistock-icon-256.png</iconUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://aptistock.com/legal/terms</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/AptiStock/AptiStockX/tree/main/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://aptistock.com/docs</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/AptiStock/AptiStockX/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <summary>Local-first desktop stock charting and portfolio research software.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
AptiStockX is a native, local-first desktop application for stock charting and portfolio research.

Features include:

* Searchable global stock symbol catalog and Global Market Stock Viewer
* Candlestick and OHLC charts with technical indicators
* Drawing studies, watchlists, workspaces, and multi-monitor workflows
* Downloadable market data through user-configured providers
* Local storage for chart files, workspaces, watchlists, and downloaded data
* Basic, 7-day Pro Trial, and paid Pro license modes

AptiStockX Basic is free to use. Pro features require a trial or a paid AptiStockX Pro license. AptiStockX is research and analysis software and does not provide financial advice, brokerage, or trade execution services.

The installer performs a per-user installation under the current user's LocalAppData folder. Silent uninstall preserves downloaded data, charts, workspaces, watchlists, custom indicators, settings, credentials, provider configuration, and installed license data.
    ]]></description>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[
AptiStockX 3.1.0 adds global market discovery, a searchable symbol catalog, verified catalog updates, new drawing and measurement tools, and chart-rendering fixes. See https://aptistock.com/changelog for the complete release notes.
    ]]></releaseNotes>
